Command list for Discorki:

- **/add**: Add a user to Discorki. Options: `discord-username` (The user to add) and `riot-id` (The Riot ID of the account, e.g. `Faker#KR1`)
- **/remove**: Remove a user from Discorki. Options: `discord-username` (The user to remove)
- **/list**: List all users in Discorki
- **/leaderboard**: Get ranked leaderboard for all summoners in this server
- **/unlink**: Unlink a summoner from a user. Options: `discord-username` (The user to unlink a summoner from) and `riot-id` (The Riot ID of the account to unlink)
- **/channel**: Set the default channel for Discorki to post in. Options: `channel` (The channel to post in)
- **/debug**: Discorki developers only - Get debug info
- **/aram**: Generate aram teams. Options: `other-captain` (Other team captain (you're the first)), `other-players` (The rest of the players, comma separated), `champion-amount` (Number of champions each player gets) and `champion-class` (Only use champions of this class)
- **/latest**: Get the latest match of a player. Options: `riot-id` (The Riot ID of the account)
- **/help**: Show information about commands